{
  "id": "JOB.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 24",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why, seeing times are not hidden from the Almighty, do they that know him not see his days?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Some",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "remove the landmarks; they violently take away flocks, and feed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thereof",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They drive away the ass of the fatherless, they take the widow's ox for a pledge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They turn the needy out of the way: the poor of the earth hide themselves together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wild asses in the desert, go they forth to their work; rising betimes for a prey: the wilderness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yieldeth",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "food for them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "children.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They reap",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "every one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his corn in the field: and they gather the vintage of the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They cause the naked to lodge without clothing, that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they have",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no covering in the cold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are wet with the showers of the mountains, and embrace the rock for want of a shelter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They pluck the fatherless from the breast, and take a pledge of the poor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They cause",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to go naked without clothing, and they take away the sheaf",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "from",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the hungry;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "make oil within their walls,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tread",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "winepresses, and suffer thirst.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Men groan from out of the city, and the soul of the wounded crieth out: yet God layeth not folly",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are of those that rebel against the light; they know not the ways thereof, nor abide in the paths thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The murderer rising with the light killeth the poor and needy, and in the night is as a thief.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The eye also of the adulterer waiteth for the twilight, saying, No eye shall see me: and disguiseth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "face.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the dark they dig through houses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they had marked for themselves in the daytime: they know not the light.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the morning",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to them even as the shadow of death: if",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "know",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them, they are in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the terrors of the shadow of death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.24.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.24.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "swift as the waters; their portion is cursed in the earth: he beholdeth not the way of the vineyards.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
